--- !u!114 &685758940
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 685758939}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0838774d98032454bb7e5f4ce8ae16ac, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Hiya!! What brings you around here?
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: -580572323, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: Hii! I saw your two other brothers just over there! You look very different!
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Huh? We're all the same monotone grey...
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: -1831384829, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: I can sense the colors I guess... nevermind...
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: 'Haha! Colors! '
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Well, I will teach you more attacks... Maybe I will see the world in color
      just like you...
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Enemies are stunned after a dash kick or a basic attack. Clicking F in
      this time frame will grab the enemy and pin them to the ground.
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Doing so will allow you to stomp on them, dealing crazy damage.
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Hold ; to stomp, and once you've stomped on the enemy click ; again to
      punt them away, deaing a large sum of damage and knocking them far away!
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: One more thing; holding S and spamming L will allow you to preform a downslam!
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: It puts the enemy into the ground, allowing you to follow up on other attacks.
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Well, that's all I have for now! The enemies ahead are rather tanky, try
      using these abilities to chunk their HP!
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: -1831384829, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: Wow! Thank you sooo much for this information!
  - speakerName: Lucerna
    portrait: {fileID: 955586193, guid: daf994ec40988d54f985ff03748950bc, type: 3}
    text: You and your brothers are by far the coolest statues in this place!
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Aww, thank you!
  - speakerName: Helmet Statue
    portrait: {fileID: -1711806156, guid: 344cb1b9ba5c4b540a6d80d484f4e76a, type: 3}
    text: Good luck with your journey!
  interactPrompt: {fileID: 2103825169}
  bobSpeed: 1.5
  bobAmount: 0.05
  playerTag: Player
